#Linux
Ħruġ ikteb: (Kmand ls -la), linja-ġdida.
Ħruġ ikteb: (Mogħdija /home gabor Desktop), linja-ġdida.
Ħruġ ikteb: (Mogħdija /root: ['my\\ documents'], business presentations), linja-ġdida.
